Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 11:19:21 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 13/14] feat(app): declare the patch build on the About page

A self-built APK should not look like an official release. Add a
'Patchwork build' badge to the About header plus Build type / Upstream base rows
and a note explaining what the local patches are and that the APK is not
published by the Fcitx5 for Android project (en / zh-CN / zh-TW).
---
